<title>BELARUS: Belarus Jan-Aug ind. output up 0.4 pct from '95.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan-Aug ind. output up 0.4 pct from '95.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus's industrial output for the first eight months of the year rose 0.4 percent from the same period last year, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    BELARUS INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT  Aug 96    July 96    Aug 95</p>
<p> mth/mth percentage		+5.4	+4.2	 n/a</p>
<p> yr/yr percentage		  +2.9	+10.8	-13.4</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
